    <briefdescription>
<para>YAML值的抽象基类 </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>所有YAML值类型的基类，定义了YAML值树的公共接口和类型系统。</para>
<para>每个 <ref refid="classneforce_1_1yaml__value" kindref="compound">yaml_value</ref> 节点可携带可选的锚点和标签元数据：<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classneforce_1_1yaml__value_1a1fe2d4f8ad791c660dc48e7597169cf6" kindref="member">anchor</ref></computeroutput>：锚点名（对应YAML中的 &amp;anchor 语法）</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classneforce_1_1yaml__value_1a78cac1dcb3ccf1163a9f81da5fdce7dc" kindref="member">tag</ref></computeroutput>：类型标签（对应YAML中的 !tag 语法）</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>此类为抽象基类，不可直接实例化。 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>使用 <ref refid="classneforce_1_1yaml__value_1ae7f289c9fe5be7ff0ab9364a183bcb4c" kindref="member">type()</ref> 配合 as_*() 方法进行类型安全的向下转型。 </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
